.TH swarm-unseed 1  "swarm 0.1.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-unseed \- Stop serving a repo but keep its store
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm unseed\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fILINK\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stop serving a repo but keep its store
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object on stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fILINK\fR>
A repo ID or link
